Robotiq 3F Gripper model

Derived from the Robotiq3fGripper PROTO distributed in Cyberbotics Webots R2025a:
https://github.com/cyberbotics/webots/blob/R2025a/projects/devices/robotiq/protos/Robotiq3fGripper.proto

Upstream work is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Modifications:
- Converted the six inline Webots IndexedFaceSet geometries to triangulated OBJ files.
- Ported the Webots rigid-body and hinge hierarchy to MuJoCo MJCF.
- Reoriented the model to Critter's +Z tool axis and added attachment/tool-center sites.
- Added MuJoCo actuators, contact settings, and named open/closed keyframes.
